{"id":"f7203f443774bd53","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-filtration.md","title":"Filtration Lemma","display":"lem-filtration — Filtration Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-filtration","aliases":["89-lem-filtration"],"display":"lem-filtration — Filtration Lemma","depends_on":["[[89-df-filtration]]","[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-kripke-model]]","[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-filtration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-filtration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-filtration — Filtration Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"170626a7dad88370\" href=\"?note=170626a7dad88370\" title=\"89-df-filtration\">89-df-filtration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9f00301866fbd6f0\" href=\"?note=9f00301866fbd6f0\" title=\"89-df-satisfaction-modal\">89-df-satisfaction-modal</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}=(W,R,V)\">\\(\\mathcal{M}=(W,R,V)\\)</span> is a Kripke model.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is finite and closed under subformulas.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}_{\\Gamma}\">\\(\\mathcal{M}_{\\Gamma}\\)</span> is a filtration of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\">\\(\\mathcal M\\)</span> through <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}filtration}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal{M},w\\models\\varphi\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal{M}_{\\Gamma},[w]_{\\Gamma}\\models\\varphi\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}filtration}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal{M},w\\models\\varphi\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal{M}_{\\Gamma},[w]_{\\Gamma}\\models\\varphi\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}^\\Gamma\">\\(\\mathcal{M}^\\Gamma\\)</span> : 过滤模型 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"170626a7dad88370\" href=\"?note=170626a7dad88370\" title=\"89-df-filtration\">89-df-filtration</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> : 公式集 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a>)</li>\n<li>过滤保持<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>中公式的真值</li>\n<li>有限模型性质的证明工具</li>\n<li>这里的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_\\Gamma\">\\(\\mathcal M_\\Gamma\\)</span> 必须是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"170626a7dad88370\" href=\"?note=170626a7dad88370\" title=\"89-df-filtration\">89-df-filtration</a> 所给出的过滤\n（特别是其 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_\\Gamma\">\\(R_\\Gamma\\)</span> 夹在最小与最大过滤关系之间）；任意商模型并\n不自动满足该真值引理。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-filtration","status":"resolved","id":"170626a7dad88370","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-filtration]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-satisfaction-modal","status":"resolved","id":"9f00301866fbd6f0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-filtration","status":"resolved","id":"170626a7dad88370","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{M}^\\Gamma$ : 过滤模型 (see [[89-df-filtration]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma$ : 公式集 (see [[89-df-modal-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-filtration","status":"resolved","id":"170626a7dad88370","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"这里的 $\\mathcal M_\\Gamma$ 必须是 [[89-df-filtration]] 所给出的过滤\n（特别是其 $R_\\Gamma$ 夹在最小与最大过滤关系之间）；任意商模型并\n不自动满足该真值引理。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal{M}=(W,R,V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{M}_{\\Gamma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}filtration}\\vdash\n\\forall\\varphi\\in\\Gamma\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal{M},w\\models\\varphi\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathcal{M}_{\\Gamma},[w]_{\\Gamma}\\models\\varphi\n\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{M}^\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M_\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"R_\\Gamma","display":false}],"bytes":1201,"backlinks":[{"id":"170626a7dad88370","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-lem-filtration]]：过滤保持真值引理"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-425","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-lem-filtration]]"}],"outgoing":["170626a7dad88370","56c1b5b75a32ca1d","ab746eb779e20ce0","9f00301866fbd6f0"]}